\section{NA handling}{

A segment with no counterpart carries \code{NA}. For the averages that is a
genuine zero -- nothing was matched -- so it is treated as one, and separately
reported as \code{frac_no_overlap}. Dropping those rows instead would score a
caller that invents fifty spurious segments identically to one that invents
none.
